1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,406
The first promise of the arc was made in a room with a red banner and a bear on the city crest: the meeting would show the evidence, not the party line.

2
00:00:09,406 --> 00:00:15,704
“A democratic process is not a party conference,” the representative said.

3
00:00:15,704 --> 00:00:19,389
“It is a jury with an audience.”

4
00:00:19,389 --> 00:00:26,248
The poor would be hurt first and the corporate lobby last, and everybody in the room knew it.

5
00:00:26,248 --> 00:00:32,062
“We must introduce the numbers before the vote,” Maya wrote in her article.

6
00:00:32,062 --> 00:00:47,284
“A minority of ten thousand people cannot bear a revolution in fares alone.” The transcript of the meeting would be published in full, including the confession that the first estimate had been wrong.

7
00:00:47,284 --> 00:00:56,532
The conservative member, the progressive member, and the politician from the east district all had a bond with the utilities.

8
00:00:56,532 --> 00:01:00,872
“We acknowledge the allegation,” the mayor said.

9
00:01:00,872 --> 00:01:14,139
“We do not accept the nuisance of a closed budget.” A jail sentence for piracy of the city's software was on the same agenda, which made the room laugh bitterly.

10
00:01:14,139 --> 00:01:18,893
The revenue question was harder than the taxation question.

11
00:01:18,893 --> 00:01:30,206
“A terrorism trial, a terrorist arrest, a vacation cancelled: none of that helps us fund a treatment plant,” the treasurer said.

12
00:01:30,206 --> 00:01:34,991
“What helps is a fare that a poor family can pay.”

13
00:01:34,991 --> 00:01:42,559
The promise was to publish the succession of costs and the defection of the suppliers before the next session.

14
00:01:42,559 --> 00:01:54,302
A contentious reformation of the fare system, a condemnation from the lobby, and a socialize programme for the water users were all on the list.

15
00:01:54,302 --> 00:02:06,010
The imagine part was the hardest: to ask the couple at the fair, the leg of the west market, and the natural scepticism of the tea stall what they would pay.

16
00:02:06,010 --> 00:02:11,099
“A direct question is worth a stick of evidence,” Lin said.

17
00:02:11,099 --> 00:02:27,591
“We will introduce nothing that the audience cannot see.” Different people, the same difficulty: a direct question about the east market, the fair, the floor of the west hall, and the leg of the investment.

18
00:02:27,591 --> 00:02:35,484
We could imagine the hurt of a poor family, but the tea and the stick of evidence had to be produced before the vote.

19
00:02:35,484 --> 00:02:49,645
The world versus the city, a brain versus a budget, a republican versus a progressive: a bankruptcy, a convert, and an outing were all that the party could offer.
